    "html": "<p>An aircraft of mass M turns in a horizontal circle. The net force on the aircraft is F.</p>\n<p>A second aircraft makes a horizontal turn with double the radius at the same speed. The mass of the second aircraft is 1.5 M.</p>\n<p>What is the net force on the second aircraft?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span>F</li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span>F</li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span>F</li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span>F</li></ol>"
